Package: move-reminder
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Move Reminder Maintainers <maintainers@example.com>
Installed-Size: 22
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-notify-0.7, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, libnotify-bin, libcanberra-gtk3-module, libcanberra-gtk3-0, pulseaudio-utils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Tray timer reminder for movement breaks
 Move Reminder is a small Ubuntu GNOME tray application.
 It runs a one-shot timer and notifies you with sound when time is up.
